    "headline": "MarketLeap Expands U.S. Operations to Accelerate Global Ecommerce Expansion",
    "summary": "NEW YORK, July 28, 2026--MarketLeap.ai, the AI-powered ecommerce platform and marketplace accelerator, today announced a full-scale expansion of its U.S. operations to help consumer brands automate and expand their sales across global marketplaces. Built around agentic, AI-driven commerce, the platform operates as the seller of record on the brand's behalf, handling compliance, logistics, advertising, customer experience, aftersales and inventory management.",
